            "message": "Abandoned\n\nIn light of the feedback from Amithash and Patrick, we have decided to abandon this commit, as \"there is no such thing as a 'presence sensor'\".\nWe plan to propose a new solution to handle the sensor-missing case. I believe that resolving this scenario should also address the original issue."
